{"4842850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BirdBots", "steam_appid": 4842850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5095700], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842850/extras/4f3b44cb8dc91197f58b657c6c8c6b1a.poster.avif?t=1787022102\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842850/extras/4f3b44cb8dc91197f58b657c6c8c6b1a.webm?t=1787022102\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842850/extras/4f3b44cb8dc91197f58b657c6c8c6b1a.mp4?t=1787022102\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br>HUMANITY HAS VANISHED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The war ended long ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cities were destroyed, the surface fell under the control of hostile machines, and the last survivors disappeared into the depths below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before humanity fell, it launched its final project: BirdBots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration machines powered by human brains, capable of navigating tunnels, ruins, and hostile territories in search of answers about what truly happened—and whether hope still remains beyond the underground world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, you are one of them.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER THE SKIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly through claustrophobic tunnels, abandoned factories, forgotten sewers, sealed forests, and vast industrial complexes while avoiding traps, obstacles, and mechanical threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BirdBots combines speed, precision, and exploration in an accessible yet challenging flight system where every movement matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your reflexes to the test as you navigate dangerous environments filled with hazards, narrow passages, and hidden routes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842850/extras/e6edbb1484e97f8134ff4bc80cab45c3.poster.avif?t=1787022102\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842850/extras/e6edbb1484e97f8134ff4bc80cab45c3.webm?t=1787022102\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842850/extras/e6edbb1484e97f8134ff4bc80cab45c3.mp4?t=1787022102\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE A FORGOTTEN WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every portal leads to a new region filled with secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the remains of ancient human civilizations, abandoned facilities, and isolated locations that have remained untouched for decades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you venture into the underground world, the closer you'll come to uncovering the truth behind humanity's fate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br>UNLOCK NEW BIRDBOTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock unique BirdBot models inspired by different birds and flight styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each BirdBot features its own characteristics:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Speed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Maneuverability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Durability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Flight Handling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the BirdBot that best suits each mission and adapt your playstyle to overcome every challenge.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842850/extras/c5b645aa0868f1dbd8dca076263dc2e4.poster.avif?t=1787022102\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842850/extras/c5b645aa0868f1dbd8dca076263dc2e4.webm?t=1787022102\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842850/extras/c5b645aa0868f1dbd8dca076263dc2e4.mp4?t=1787022102\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE RESISTANCE HIDEOUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between expeditions, return to an underground refuge inhabited by allied machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the hideout to:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Repair damaged BirdBots</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Unlock new portals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Customize colors and appearances</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Track achievements and trophies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Discover fragments of the story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Meet the inhabitants of the refuge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every conversation reveals a little more about the world that once existed.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842850/extras/79091a0404cab313f2288dfba914e331.poster.avif?t=1787022102\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842850/extras/79091a0404cab313f2288dfba914e331.webm?t=1787022102\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842850/extras/79091a0404cab313f2288dfba914e331.mp4?t=1787022102\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENEMIES AND DANGERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tunnels are far from empty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face floating mines, mechanical trees, police drones, industrial traps, robotic creatures, and massive bosses that will put your flying skills to the ultimate test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The surface may have fallen, but its dangers are still very much alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fast and precise arcade-style flight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Exploration of tunnels and post-apocalyptic environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Original science-fiction storyline</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Unlockable BirdBots</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Visual customization options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Interactive central hideout</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Multiple biomes and unique environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Enemies, traps, and epic bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Exploration-driven progression and discovery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Atmospheric soundtrack<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842850/extras/f5d6b1cd167474c4fb2ff16b5528cd33.poster.avif?t=1787022102\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842850/extras/f5d6b1cd167474c4fb2ff16b5528cd33.webm?t=1787022102\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842850/extras/f5d6b1cd167474c4fb2ff16b5528cd33.mp4?t=1787022102\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842850/extras/4f3b44cb8dc91197f58b657c6c8c6b1a.poster.avif?t=1787022102\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842850/extras/4f3b44cb8dc91197f58b657c6c8c6b1a.webm?t=1787022102\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842850/extras/4f3b44cb8dc91197f58b657c6c8c6b1a.mp4?t=1787022102\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br>HUMANITY HAS VANISHED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The war ended long ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cities were destroyed, the surface fell under the control of hostile machines, and the last survivors disappeared into the depths below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before humanity fell, it launched its final project: BirdBots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration machines powered by human brains, capable of navigating tunnels, ruins, and hostile territories in search of answers about what truly happened—and whether hope still remains beyond the underground world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, you are one of them.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER THE SKIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly through claustrophobic tunnels, abandoned factories, forgotten sewers, sealed forests, and vast industrial complexes while avoiding traps, obstacles, and mechanical threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BirdBots combines speed, precision, and exploration in an accessible yet challenging flight system where every movement matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your reflexes to the test as you navigate dangerous environments filled with hazards, narrow passages, and hidden routes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842850/extras/e6edbb1484e97f8134ff4bc80cab45c3.poster.avif?t=1787022102\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842850/extras/e6edbb1484e97f8134ff4bc80cab45c3.webm?t=1787022102\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842850/extras/e6edbb1484e97f8134ff4bc80cab45c3.mp4?t=1787022102\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE A FORGOTTEN WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every portal leads to a new region filled with secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the remains of ancient human civilizations, abandoned facilities, and isolated locations that have remained untouched for decades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you venture into the underground world, the closer you'll come to uncovering the truth behind humanity's fate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br>UNLOCK NEW BIRDBOTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock unique BirdBot models inspired by different birds and flight styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each BirdBot features its own characteristics:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Speed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Maneuverability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Durability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Flight Handling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the BirdBot that best suits each mission and adapt your playstyle to overcome every challenge.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842850/extras/c5b645aa0868f1dbd8dca076263dc2e4.poster.avif?t=1787022102\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842850/extras/c5b645aa0868f1dbd8dca076263dc2e4.webm?t=1787022102\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842850/extras/c5b645aa0868f1dbd8dca076263dc2e4.mp4?t=1787022102\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE RESISTANCE HIDEOUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between expeditions, return to an underground refuge inhabited by allied machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the hideout to:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Repair damaged BirdBots</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Unlock new portals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Customize colors and appearances</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Track achievements and trophies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Discover fragments of the story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Meet the inhabitants of the refuge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every conversation reveals a little more about the world that once existed.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842850/extras/79091a0404cab313f2288dfba914e331.poster.avif?t=1787022102\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842850/extras/79091a0404cab313f2288dfba914e331.webm?t=1787022102\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4842850/extras/79091a0404cab313f2288dfba914e331.mp4?t=1787022102\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENEMIES AND DANGERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tunnels are far from empty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face floating mines, mechanical trees, police drones, industrial traps, robotic creatures, and massive bosses that will put your flying skills to the ultimate test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The surface may have fallen, but its dangers are still very much alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fast and precise arcade-style flight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Exploration of tunnels and post-apocalyptic environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Original science-fiction storyline</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Unlockable BirdBots</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Visual customization options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Interactive central hideout</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Multiple biomes and unique environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Enemies, traps, and epic bosses</p><p class